<div id="main">
	<div id="content-top"><h2>JON FARHAT: Visual Effects Supervisor and Director</h2></div>
	<div id="content">
		<div class="subcolumn1-2">
			<h3>FIRST PERSON SHOOTER</h3>
			<h4>5:30 Single Shot</h4>
			<a href="" target="profiles/fpsout2-jfisite800" title="First Person Shooter:800Kbps"><img src="http://jfi.net/jfisite/venue/images/pinky.gif" alt="FPS" width="100" height="66" border="0" class="left"></a>
			<p>Designed and directed by Jon Farhat for the Feature Film DOOM.</p>
			<div class="clicktoview"><a href="" target="profiles/fpsout2-jfisiteLAN" title="First Person Shooter:1.5Mbps" class="jump qt last">For 1.5 Mbps</a></div>
		</div>
		<div class="subcolumn2-2">
			<h3>PAST VFX WORK</h3>
			<h4>Presented by Film Title</h4>
			<a href="" target="profiles/ReelWeb-jfisite800" title="Selected VFX"><img src="http://jfi.net/jfisite/venue/images/papa.gif" alt="VFX" width="100" height="66" border="0" class="left"></a>
			<p>Visual Effects Supervisor and Effects Unit Director over the last ten years.</p>
			<div class="clicktoview"><a href="" target="profiles/ReelWeb-jfisiteLAN" title="Selected VFX" class="jump qt last">For 1.5 Mbps</a></div>
		</div>
		<div class="clearer">&nbsp;</div>

		<div class="subcolumn1-2">
			<h3>RANGE OF MOTION</h3>
			<h4>A Montage cut to music</h4>
			<a href="" target="profiles/montageout-jfisite800" title="Range of Motion:800Kbps"><img src="http://jfi.net/jfisite/venue/images/montage.gif" alt="Assault of the Earth" width="100" height="66" border="0" class="left"></a>
			<p>This montage was presented as a lecture, illustrating the similarities in timing between comedy and horror.</p>
			<div class="clicktoview"><a href="" target="profiles/montageout-jfisiteLAN" title="Range of Motion:1.5Mbps" class="jump qt last">For 1.5 Mbps</a></div>
		</div>
		<div class="subcolumn2-2">
			<h3>SHORT FILMS</h3>
			<h4>Directed by Jon Farhat</h4>
			<a href="" target="profiles/foolWeb-H.264800Kbps" title="The Fool"><img src="http://jfi.net/jfisite/venue/images/clete.gif" alt="The Fool" width="100" height="66" border="0" class="left"></a>
			<p>Just your basic seven minute tragic comedy musical. Streams at 800Kbps.</p>
			<div class="clicktoview"><a href="" target="profiles/foolWeb-H.264-LAN" title="The Fool" class="jump qt last">For 1.5 Mbps</a></div>
		</div>
		<div class="clearer">&nbsp;</div>
	</div>
